recovery_metadata.single_facet_prompt:
Generate ONE concise English academic search query for the assigned facet, using only the original question and extracted constraints. Preserve explicit named entities and task restrictions relevant to this facet. Do not invent a benchmark, dataset, model, method, or technical mechanism. Do not merely replace papers with research. Do not broaden away the core task. Return ONLY a JSON object with query (string) and covered_constraints (array of constraint FIELD NAMES). Do not return a facet label, list, Search/Expand tag, explanation, or search results. The facet assignment is managed by the program. Do not include site/date operators.
USER QUESTION: {question}
CONSTRAINTS: {constraints}
ASSIGNED FACET: {facet}
ALL PLANNED FACETS (different roles): {facets}
